sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant CF as Connection Fiber
    participant P as RespSrvParser
    participant S as Service
    participant CR as CommandRegistry
    participant CS as CmdSet coroutine
    participant T as Transaction
    participant Q as EngineShard::queue_
    participant ES as EngineShard
    participant DB as DbSlice
    participant RJ as Tiering / Journal
    participant RB as RedisReplyBuilder
    participant K as FiberSocket

    C->>CF: *3 ... SET key value
    CF->>P: Parse(buffer)
    P-->>CF: ["SET", "key", "value"]
    CF->>S: DispatchCommand(args, ParsedCommand, async_pref)
    S->>CR: FindExtended(args)
    CR-->>S: CommandId(SET) + tail args
    S->>S: VerifyCommandState
    S->>T: PrepareTransaction + InitByArgs
    S->>CS: CommandId::Invoke -> CmdSet(parser, context)
    CS->>CS: ParseSetParams
    CS->>T: co_await cmd::SingleHop(callback)
    T->>Q: Add(target shard, schedule callback)
    Q->>ES: ScheduleInShard / PollExecution
    ES->>CS: callback(Transaction*, EngineShard*)
    CS->>DB: SetCmd::Set(key, value)
    DB->>DB: FindMutable 或 AddOrFind
    DB->>RJ: PostEdit: tiering / explicit journal
    ES-->>T: FinishHop -> run_barrier Dec
    T-->>CS: await 完成
    CS->>RB: SendOk()
    RB->>K: sink_->Write(iovec...)
    K-->>C: +OK
